sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Local CRDT call
    participant A as Node A
    participant B as Selected peer B
    participant C as Peer C
    W->>A: Update CRDT
    A->>A: Accept state, operation ID, and replay metadata together
    A-->>W: Success under the chosen durability contract
    A->>B: Gossip accepted operation
    B->>B: Persist unseen operation before publishing
    B->>C: Forward with original operation ID
    C->>C: Persist unseen operation or ignore duplicate
    Note over A,C: Periodic anti-entropy repairs missed updates within the declared recovery contract
